<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus tenders for 18,000 tonnes maize.</title>
<headline>Cyprus tenders for 18,000 tonnes maize.</headline>
<dateline>CYPRUS 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission said it invited tenders for one cargo of 18,000 tonnes of maize, with the tender closing December 30 and shipment January 1997.</p>
<p>The invitation for tenders was made in a statement dated December 23 but issued on Friday.</p>
